flowchart TD
  Cell[Read the original cell<br/>keep its raw value]
  Mapping{Known mapping?}
  Normalize[Normalize to canonical value<br/>preserve raw alongside it]
  Review[Mark Needs review<br/>retain raw value and reason]
  Derived{Derived field?}
  Recompute[Recompute from source inputs<br/>compare with supplied value]
  Flag[Flag mismatch for review<br/>never trust typed derived value]
  Color{Colored source text?}
  Assumed[Mark provenance as assumed<br/>keep value visible for confirmation]
  Source[Keep source provenance]
  Notes{Free-text notes?}
  Dates[Extract dates deterministically]
  LLM[Optionally ask LLM for suggestions<br/>with evidence; never overwrite source]
  Human[Human reviews, edits, accepts or dismisses]
  Store[(Save in the single dataset<br/>with raw values and provenance)]

  Cell --> Mapping
  Mapping -- yes --> Normalize --> Derived
  Mapping -- no --> Review --> Derived
  Derived -- yes --> Recompute --> Color
  Recompute -->|mismatch| Flag --> Color
  Derived -- no --> Color
  Color -- yes --> Assumed --> Notes
  Color -- no --> Source --> Notes
  Notes -- yes --> Dates --> Human
  Notes -. optional .-> LLM --> Human
  Human --> Store
  Notes -- no --> Store
